<title>USA: FBI agent pleads not guilty to spy charges.</title>
<headline>FBI agent pleads not guilty to spy charges.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Bureau of Investigation agent Earl Pitts pleaded not guilty on Monday to charges of spying for Moscow.</p>
<p>A federal judge set April 21 for trial after Pitts waived his right to a speedy trial.</p>
</text>
